cff-version: 1.2.0
title: FieldX
message: "If you use this software, please cite the software release and the associated method paper."
type: software
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-09-08
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/YOUR-ORG/FieldX"
abstract: >-
  Direct refinement of experimental crystallographic density starting from an already
  refined atomistic model, using a spatially correlated, band-limited density-field
  correction inferred from Bragg observations.
keywords:
  - crystallography
  - electron density
  - Bayesian inference
  - JAX
  - Gemmi
